4309:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c **** /**
4310:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****   * @brief RX interrupt handler for 9 bits data word length .
4311:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****   * @note   Function is called under interruption only, once
